OL,3,GNEWSACostume exhibition celebrates 50
OL,4,Ayears of city's 'spaceship-like'
OL,5,Atheatre
OL,6,
OL,7,FFifty years ago, the Royal Exchange
OL,8,FTheatre in Manchester opened its doors
OL,9,Ffor its first production of Richard
OL,10,FBrinsley Sheridan's The Rivals.
OL,12,FIt was September 1976, and the
OL,13,Fseven-sided theatre constructed from
OL,14,Ftubular steel in the heart of the city
OL,15,Fwas described by some as something from
OL,16,Fout of space.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,409,400,260,160,0,100
