OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F408A1789711153
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSACostume exhibition celebrates 50
OL,4,Ayears of city's 'spaceship-like'
OL,5,Atheatre
OL,6,
OL,7,F"It sits almost like a spaceship inside
OL,8,Fthis extraordinary great Victorian Hall
OL,9,Fwith all the pillars so already you
OL,10,Fhave this tension," said Selina
OL,11,FCartmell, the theatre's creative
OL,12,Fdirector.
OL,14,F"They created a theatre of 750 seats in
OL,15,Fthe round, a democratic arena where the
OL,16,Falchemy between actor and audience is
OL,17,Fat its most purest form and they've
OL,18,Fcreated something that still feels
OL,19,Ffresh today."
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
